WEBVTT

00:06.800 --> 00:08.199
What the hell?!

00:10.971 --> 00:13.565
Hey, Curly Locks!
What did you do?!

00:13.740 --> 00:14.900
Don't be stupid!

00:17.411 --> 00:20.073
The end has finally come.

00:21.081 --> 00:22.708
Th-That voice!

00:23.817 --> 00:24.647
Pairon!

00:27.187 --> 00:28.381
Fall!

00:28.889 --> 00:30.550
Fall to the bottom of the earth!

00:31.091 --> 00:32.888
The bottom of the earth?!

00:33.660 --> 00:34.490
No way!

00:35.929 --> 00:37.487
He's sending us down
to the slums!

00:38.065 --> 00:39.259
The slums?!

00:39.333 --> 00:41.426
N-No way!

00:41.501 --> 00:42.331
Slums?

00:43.503 --> 00:45.164
Everyone get out of here!

01:02.723 --> 01:05.886
I can't believe he'd blow open
the plate passages!

01:05.959 --> 01:08.860
Damn!
What's going on, Blondie?!

01:11.431 --> 01:12.864
We're going down.

01:13.400 --> 01:14.958
Down to the bottom.

01:23.243 --> 01:25.939
Miss Rorec!

01:28.515 --> 01:30.142
Rumina!

01:30.217 --> 01:32.276
Not again!

01:55.442 --> 01:59.879
It is an honor to be able
to die with you, Miss Rorec!

01:59.946 --> 02:03.177
But I still don't really want to die.

02:03.250 --> 02:07.186
There's no way that
I'm going to die with Rorec!

02:09.156 --> 02:10.214
Damn...

02:12.159 --> 02:13.751
How could it end like this.

02:34.281 --> 02:35.680
Ruri!

02:35.749 --> 02:36.716
Ruri's...!

02:37.150 --> 02:39.118
Waiting for me!

02:42.289 --> 02:43.051
Rumina!

02:43.256 --> 02:44.814
I see! Using the wind!

02:45.225 --> 02:46.954
Asagi Swordsmanship!

02:49.963 --> 02:50.895
No!

02:55.735 --> 02:56.724
Blondie!

02:57.304 --> 02:58.999
I can see the bottom now!

03:01.942 --> 03:03.967
Asagi Swordsmanship!

03:05.779 --> 03:08.043
Wind Storm!

03:16.590 --> 03:18.751
Rumina!

03:19.559 --> 03:22.050
Miss Rorec!

03:38.445 --> 03:39.469
Ow...

03:47.554 --> 03:49.283
This is too much...

04:04.204 --> 04:05.398
This is...

04:32.365 --> 04:37.462
HEY YOU!
If you keep sulking and
watch the world go by

04:38.405 --> 04:43.035
Nothing will ever happen
So don't run away

04:43.777 --> 04:49.977
If you have a future
that you can run to

04:50.050 --> 04:55.420
There's no time to be depressed

04:56.323 --> 05:02.489
Everyone gets lost
from time to time

05:02.562 --> 05:08.467
But we keep living
every day that we are granted

05:08.535 --> 05:14.667
Things that we must not lose

05:14.741 --> 05:20.737
We must protect
even if we get hurt

05:20.814 --> 05:26.980
Still we can believe
in our strength

05:27.053 --> 05:32.491
To be able to get up
and walk again

05:41.701 --> 05:44.838
Slums - The Town of Traitors
Slums - The Town of Traitors.

05:44.838 --> 05:48.205
Slums - The Town of Traitors

05:55.181 --> 05:56.910
This is so relaxing...

05:57.717 --> 05:59.582
I feel like I'm being revived.

05:59.753 --> 06:02.517
Don't you agree, little one...

06:02.956 --> 06:04.321
I'm not "little one"!

06:05.058 --> 06:06.855
My name is Korin!

06:06.926 --> 06:09.019
Korin, the magnet user!

06:09.262 --> 06:10.627
You better remember that!

06:11.398 --> 06:13.423
Fine, fine. Whatever.

06:13.566 --> 06:15.033
Just listen to me!

06:15.935 --> 06:18.961
What's with that sky, anyway?
Don't mess around!

06:25.045 --> 06:26.535
Why not? It sets the mood.

06:26.613 --> 06:27.773
Not at all!

06:28.548 --> 06:31.142
Do you have any idea
where you are?!

06:31.217 --> 06:33.583
These are the slums!
The bottom of the pit!

06:33.853 --> 06:37.482
A lawless land that would make
a baby stop crying!

06:38.024 --> 06:39.457
I know that.

06:39.526 --> 06:42.154
That's why we've got to
work together, right?

06:42.228 --> 06:45.322
So we can find Ginnosuke
and your brother, too.

06:46.333 --> 06:49.530
Anyway, we found a good bath...

06:49.602 --> 06:51.502
...so let's at least give ourselves
a bit of a rest.

06:52.238 --> 06:53.398
It's because of you!

06:54.007 --> 06:57.204
It's because you had to use
your wind power...

06:57.277 --> 06:58.676
...that this happened!

07:01.214 --> 07:02.977
If I didn't use it, we'd all be dead!

07:03.049 --> 07:04.744
Blame Pairon!

07:05.185 --> 07:06.652
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

07:06.720 --> 07:10.656
You're just a loser, kid!
You need an attitude adjustment!

07:10.724 --> 07:11.782
Don't you call me a kid!

07:11.858 --> 07:14.224
Besides, you're a kid yourself!
So get off your high horse!

07:14.294 --> 07:15.352
Why, you! Why, you!

07:15.428 --> 07:16.326
You stupid...!

07:16.396 --> 07:17.124
Shut up!

07:17.197 --> 07:17.720
Why, you!

07:17.797 --> 07:18.286
Shut up!

07:18.365 --> 07:19.229
Why, you!

07:19.799 --> 07:22.427
Shut up!

07:28.241 --> 07:30.505
A bath is supposed to be relaxing!

07:30.577 --> 07:31.908
So, settle down!

07:34.347 --> 07:37.646
How dare you use your power...

07:42.155 --> 07:46.182
In the end, after searching
for a whole day...

07:46.259 --> 07:50.252
...the only one we found
was that violent blonde girl.

07:54.167 --> 07:55.725
That's the wrong image!

08:00.640 --> 08:02.005
I'm so unlucky.

08:02.075 --> 08:05.841
Why did I end up getting stuck with her.

08:05.912 --> 08:08.073
I mean, she's just too violent.

08:08.148 --> 08:09.547
She'll use her power at the drop...

08:09.616 --> 08:11.345
My brother's still alive.

08:12.485 --> 08:13.543
I'm sure.

08:18.725 --> 08:19.623
Of course.

08:21.461 --> 08:25.022
Even Ginnosuke,
Jilherts and Emilia.

08:25.098 --> 08:27.566
Everyone who fell then
is still alive.

08:28.535 --> 08:31.402
Your brother, too.

08:37.343 --> 08:41.040
I have a feeling
there was one more...

08:45.185 --> 08:46.743
I wonder who it was.

08:52.392 --> 08:55.122
You have a cold?
Don't you give it to me.

08:55.195 --> 08:57.129
Shut up, you little kid.

08:57.797 --> 08:58.957
Here it is! Here!

09:00.233 --> 09:02.861
Do something about that
stinky body of yours!

09:02.936 --> 09:06.394
I can't help it, all right?!
I fell on a pile of garbage!

09:06.539 --> 09:09.906
Damn! This is all Rorec's fault!

09:10.143 --> 09:13.203
Next time I see her,
I'm going to tear her apart!

09:17.584 --> 09:18.516
No way! No way! No way!

09:18.585 --> 09:19.347
What's the matter?

09:21.688 --> 09:25.351
Oh, no. I lost my wallet.

09:26.292 --> 09:28.988
Look! Get it together, okay?!

09:29.762 --> 09:31.559
I thought I had it.

09:31.631 --> 09:33.599
Do you have any idea
where you lost it?

09:34.334 --> 09:35.596
Probably in the garbage.

09:35.668 --> 09:36.532
No!

09:46.045 --> 09:47.273
That was very relaxing.

09:56.623 --> 09:58.386
I would've enjoyed it more...

09:58.458 --> 10:01.086
...if it weren't
for the circumstances.

10:01.394 --> 10:02.952
Hey, sorry to keep you.

10:03.463 --> 10:04.361
You're late!

10:04.430 --> 10:06.455
Sorry. Sorry. It was this guy...

10:12.972 --> 10:13.631
What?

10:14.340 --> 10:15.466
N-Nothing...

10:25.685 --> 10:29.815
The slums were built by those
who defied the Company...

10:29.889 --> 10:32.221
...they were banished here.

10:33.426 --> 10:35.189
They defied the Company?

10:35.762 --> 10:36.456
Yeah.

10:36.829 --> 10:39.855
But since the Company
has very little power here...

10:39.933 --> 10:41.867
...it's a dangerous, lawless place.

10:42.135 --> 10:43.227
Right...

10:44.237 --> 10:47.570
They live by siphoning
electricity and heat...

10:47.640 --> 10:49.699
...from the power plant
at the center.

10:49.842 --> 10:53.608
But this is the first time
I've seen any of this.

10:53.947 --> 10:55.608
Bargain prices! Bargain prices!

10:55.915 --> 10:58.213
Hey, young man!
How about one of these?

10:58.284 --> 11:03.085
But, it's a perfect place
to hide out in, so...

11:03.156 --> 11:04.714
I don't think he's listening to you.

11:04.791 --> 11:05.587
What?!

11:07.827 --> 11:08.953
Hey, you!

11:09.028 --> 11:11.997
Don't you go wandering off
on your own!

11:13.433 --> 11:14.457
Here!

11:15.969 --> 11:16.799
What?

11:18.438 --> 11:19.837
Seashell earrings?

11:20.173 --> 11:21.970
Wha...?
What's this supposed to be?

11:22.809 --> 11:26.836
I wouldn't want people to get
suspicious due to those steely...

11:26.913 --> 11:28.540
...man-like eyes of yours.

11:28.948 --> 11:31.746
Put these on and try to look
more a girl.

11:31.884 --> 11:34.785
Think of it as a disguise.

11:35.788 --> 11:37.153
Fine.

11:37.490 --> 11:39.981
You just want me to put them on,
right?

11:40.760 --> 11:46.221
Even you must look pretty when you
put on the finer touches.

11:46.766 --> 11:47.733
Huh?

11:50.169 --> 11:53.570
Well, well.
A present for your girlfriend, kid?

11:53.640 --> 11:55.665
You sure like to show off.

11:56.175 --> 11:57.767
Who are these guys?

11:57.844 --> 12:00.039
I told you.
This is a dangerous place.

12:00.613 --> 12:03.309
How about giving us something?

12:15.094 --> 12:17.619
This is so relaxing.

12:17.697 --> 12:19.221
I feel so revived.

12:19.932 --> 12:21.229
I hope you appreciate it.

12:21.701 --> 12:25.296
I'm the one who pulled you
out from that pile of garbage.

12:25.738 --> 12:26.762
As it happened...

12:29.709 --> 12:33.645
...I was walking by
and came across you.

12:35.448 --> 12:36.574
Shalma!

12:37.817 --> 12:41.048
Thank you! Thank you so much!

12:41.120 --> 12:41.814
It's okay. It's okay.

12:41.888 --> 12:43.355
It was fate.

12:44.390 --> 12:45.049
I wasn't crying.

12:45.124 --> 12:47.592
That's how much you should
be appreciating me!

12:47.727 --> 12:50.355
But really.
It sure was a shock.

12:50.430 --> 12:54.264
I heard you were fired
from the Company...

12:54.333 --> 12:56.801
...but I never thought you'd be
in the slums.

12:56.869 --> 12:59.201
If you're banished
from the Company...

12:59.272 --> 13:02.070
...it means you can't live
in proper places anymore.

13:02.608 --> 13:05.133
This is the only place
I could come to.

13:06.079 --> 13:06.841
Shiel...

13:07.880 --> 13:10.246
But I still have no regrets.

13:12.852 --> 13:16.015
You make me sick.
You're the same as Rorec.

13:18.725 --> 13:22.024
Rorec, next time I see you,
I'll be sure to...

13:27.033 --> 13:28.193
I told you.

13:28.401 --> 13:30.528
As long as you're going to
wear earrings...

13:30.603 --> 13:31.934
...you should act like a lady.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.338
What?

13:35.475 --> 13:36.999
You want to have a go?

13:37.276 --> 13:38.573
You need help?

13:39.545 --> 13:41.069
I'll handle them on my own.

13:42.115 --> 13:43.275
You kid!

13:43.416 --> 13:44.849
Don't you dare!

13:50.957 --> 13:51.889
Wh-What...?!

13:54.527 --> 13:56.358
Asagi Swordsmanship!

13:56.429 --> 13:57.691
Wind Storm!

13:58.197 --> 13:59.289
Weak setting!

14:06.005 --> 14:06.664
Huh?

14:06.739 --> 14:08.900
You overdid it, you idiot!

14:09.242 --> 14:12.040
What? I tried to go as easy
as possible on them.

14:12.111 --> 14:14.705
Hey, you! What have you done?!

14:14.781 --> 14:17.181
Sorry. I'll pay you for it.

14:17.250 --> 14:19.184
It's not a question of money!

14:19.252 --> 14:22.619
There's an incredible power user
backing those two thugs!

14:23.055 --> 14:23.987
Power user?

14:25.224 --> 14:27.692
That's right.

14:30.363 --> 14:34.561
You see, this neighborhood
is my territory.

14:34.634 --> 14:36.795
This is power user Yo's territory.

14:36.936 --> 14:39.564
An unregistered power user, huh?

14:39.639 --> 14:41.800
So this is a power user, huh?

14:43.209 --> 14:47.043
How dare you treat
my boys like that.

14:47.246 --> 14:49.578
I'll pay you back for it!

14:50.183 --> 14:52.208
This one's a water user!

15:00.860 --> 15:03.158
This isn't water!

15:03.529 --> 15:06.726
He's an acid user!
That liquid is acid!

15:07.266 --> 15:09.461
Acid user, huh?

15:09.802 --> 15:11.269
Thanks to his power...

15:11.337 --> 15:14.465
...no one around here has been
able to stand up to him.

15:14.640 --> 15:15.766
You want help?

15:16.342 --> 15:18.572
I'll do this on my own.

15:18.644 --> 15:19.975
I'll finish him off with my next move.

15:22.014 --> 15:24.346
Is that kid going to fight him alone?

15:24.417 --> 15:25.975
Poor kid.

15:33.793 --> 15:35.852
You'll finish me off with your next move?

15:36.562 --> 15:39.725
You'll be the one
finished off next!

15:44.670 --> 15:46.604
Take that!

15:49.075 --> 15:52.010
I don't care if you're
dealing in acid or whatever.

15:52.511 --> 15:54.809
I just have to avoid it, right?!

15:56.082 --> 15:56.878
What?!

15:57.016 --> 15:58.142
Wall of wind?

15:59.218 --> 16:01.083
Asagi Swordsmanship!

16:01.354 --> 16:03.015
Wind storm!

16:14.066 --> 16:18.162
The unregistered power user
wasn't much to be reckoned with.

16:19.372 --> 16:20.862
Way to go, kid!

16:27.880 --> 16:30.508
Why do I have to
share a room with you?!

16:30.850 --> 16:35.184
There's no choice.
There's only one room available.

16:35.521 --> 16:37.318
Do you want to sleep outside?

16:37.390 --> 16:39.051
You sleep outside!

16:39.325 --> 16:40.223
Oh, my.

16:40.293 --> 16:44.821
Who's the one that said I should
be disguised as a proper lady.

16:48.768 --> 16:50.736
I've got you this time!

16:53.940 --> 16:55.567
Were there no rooms?

16:55.741 --> 16:56.435
No.

16:56.509 --> 17:00.707
That's why I told you that
you can stay in my room!

17:01.080 --> 17:02.206
You're going to charge me, right?

17:02.281 --> 17:03.179
No.

17:03.249 --> 17:06.844
You can just pay for my meals
while you're here.

17:06.919 --> 17:08.853
That'll cost me even more.

17:09.588 --> 17:13.615
Come on! Come this way!
First let's go and eat!

17:17.163 --> 17:20.758
We were trying to get to
Company headquarters from here.

17:21.434 --> 17:24.870
But because the plates passages
here were all destroyed...

17:24.937 --> 17:27.337
...we fell straight down
into the slums.

17:28.174 --> 17:30.734
So we basically
overshot the Company.

17:30.876 --> 17:35.540
The only way to get to Company
headquarters is to climb back up.

17:36.582 --> 17:38.482
But the problem is...

17:38.551 --> 17:41.179
...the slums have no fixed
way to get to a higher level.

17:43.289 --> 17:47.623
It's hard to figure out how
we can get out of here.

17:48.427 --> 17:49.621
Besides...

17:49.695 --> 17:51.959
...there's something we have to do
before we go back up.

17:52.264 --> 17:54.095
We have to get everyone together.

17:54.567 --> 17:55.056
Yeah.

17:56.736 --> 17:58.203
Any other questions.

17:58.904 --> 17:59.563
Yeah!

17:59.705 --> 18:00.467
What is it?

18:01.941 --> 18:04.171
Are you guys going out?!

18:05.444 --> 18:06.570
Don't be ridiculous!

18:06.645 --> 18:08.272
Not with this violent girl!

18:08.347 --> 18:10.212
Same here!
I wouldn't stoop so low!

18:10.282 --> 18:11.749
What did you say?!

18:11.817 --> 18:12.909
That's good!

18:13.586 --> 18:15.076
So you're not going out.

18:15.788 --> 18:18.052
If that's the case,
be my brother's bride!

18:18.190 --> 18:19.817
Then you can be my sister!

18:37.810 --> 18:39.141
Now that would be perfect!

18:39.211 --> 18:40.041
Don't you think?

18:47.420 --> 18:51.083
Enough with your stupid talk,
and just get to bed!

18:51.824 --> 18:53.451
Okay...

19:10.543 --> 19:11.339
Ow...

19:13.412 --> 19:16.279
This guy moves around a lot
in his sleep.

19:24.957 --> 19:28.393
She can be quite attractive...

19:33.432 --> 19:34.490
Smoke bomb!

19:37.303 --> 19:38.770
Huh? What? What's going on?

19:38.838 --> 19:40.999
Get under the bed!

19:56.655 --> 19:59.488
Those aren't the movements
of a human.

19:59.558 --> 20:00.820
And those nails...

20:01.694 --> 20:02.626
Could that be...

20:06.499 --> 20:09.400
Just because you're fast...

20:09.468 --> 20:12.437
...doesn't mean that
you can beat me!

20:19.879 --> 20:20.903
There!

20:27.720 --> 20:29.085
A girl?!

20:34.593 --> 20:36.754
I can't eat anymore...

20:44.570 --> 20:49.405
Again, I walk the streets today

20:49.475 --> 20:55.471
As if I have a purpose

20:55.548 --> 21:07.153
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.561 --> 21:19.529
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.605 --> 21:31.005
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.884 --> 21:40.792
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.859 --> 21:44.488
I tried to listen

21:44.563 --> 21:52.698
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.771 --> 22:01.770
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.556 --> 22:12.490
Preview

22:13.792 --> 22:18.286
Hey, listen! I figured out
how we can get out of here!

22:18.697 --> 22:20.358
We take part in that tournament!

22:20.432 --> 22:23.196
If we win, they'll grant us
any wish!

22:23.435 --> 22:25.232
And I bet Rumina and them
will take part, too!

22:25.304 --> 22:27.397
Like killing two birds
with one stone!

22:28.107 --> 22:31.042
But how will we be
able to advance?!

22:31.644 --> 22:34.374
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.446 --> 22:35.881
..."Invitation to the Killing Fields."

22:35.881 --> 22:37.616
Invitation to the Killing Fields
..."Invitation to the Killing Fields."

22:37.616 --> 22:40.449
Invitation to the Killing Fields
